# CoherynUI Cursor Rules

- Always verify classes against CoherynUI canonical grammar before outputting.
- Use canonical layout recipes (`stack`, `cluster`, `sidebar`, `grid-auto`).
- Use `.glass` and `.glass-edge` for Liquid Glass surfaces.
- Check generated classes with `coherynui check --format json`.
